# Dev log

When a change affects gameplay, controls, the city, or how the project runs, update `DEVLOG.md` in that same change.

- Add a dated entry. Do not erase older entries.
- Say what changed and why, including new keys.
- Commit the log with the change.

```markdown
## 2026-10-01 — Driver

- F leaves the plane. In the sky that opens a parachute. On the ground the driver just steps off.
```
